  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">History and Peace Education Project in Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To achieve overall goal to strengthen the national accountability and capacity to build the country&apos;s better future in peace, justice, and prosperity, this project aims at:
1) Building Sustainable Management System of CHEGA National Centre through digitization of archives and rehabilitation to create a culture of peace and driving forces for the country&apos;s reconciliation and peacebuilding.
2) Improving Quality History and Peace Education for the national capacity in History and Peace Education for Sustainable Development.
3) Strengthening the National and Regional Capacities and Partnerships for Conflict Reconciliation, Peacebuilding through North-South and South-South Cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
